I leave the noisy market.
I walk towards home.
There are two bags in my hand.
The bags are heavy now.
There are fresh tomatoes in the bag.
The tea masala is also there.
The fragrant flower garland is in my hand.
Today the market trip is good.
I know the price of the items well.
I ask - 'How much is the price?'
I give the exact money.
The Mumbai market is now simple for me.
I feel a lot of confidence now.
My apartment building is nearby.
I go there quickly.
These fresh vegetables are for dinner at night.
I want to eat them.
Today I am very happy.
